This derivative adds the ir2_benchmark JAX package, configuration, tests,
documentation and tooling. The original env.py, graph.py, graph_generator.py
and sensor.py have been modified for deterministic comparison, compatibility,
and integration. Results or claims made by the original authors do not certify
the derivative benchmark. See spec/spec-design-benchmark-status-and-discussion.md
for implementation limitations and historical validation scope.
